                                               Business Question 
How does fraudulent activity vary across transaction categories based on fraud volume, fraud rate, and fraudulent transaction value?


                                  Query
SELECT
    category,

    SUM(CASE
        WHEN fraud = 1 THEN 1
        ELSE 0
    END) AS fraudulent_transactions,

    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE
            WHEN fraud = 1 THEN 1
            ELSE 0
        END) * 100.0/ COUNT(*),
        2
    ) AS fraud_rate,

    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE
            WHEN fraud = 1 THEN amount
            ELSE 0
        END),2) AS fraudulent_transaction_value
FROM fraud_detection_data
GROUP BY category
ORDER BY fraud_rate DESC;


                                                                           INSIGHT:
These results show that the level of fraud is different across categories: Leisure has the highest fraud rate, Travel has the highest fraudulent transaction value, 
while Sports & Toys has the highest number of fraudulent transactions


